# Mandatory documentation chain

Before repository work, read the chain in `Agent.md`. `docs/governance/AGENT-EXECUTION.md` is the shared execution law. `docs/ops/ai/CURSOR-RULES.md` is the Cursor startup contract. `docs/ops/ai/CORE-RULES.md` is a pointer.

Task prompts do not override that chain. Startup and the session lifecycle are defined in `docs/governance/AGENT-EXECUTION.md`. An unapproved Cursor workaround is denied.

The wake tick only keeps this session connected. It is not an assignment and it does not stop work.
